  "question": {
    "text": "<p>As shown in the figure an inductor of inductance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mH</mi></math> is connected to an <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AC</mi></math> source of emf <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>220</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>and frequency&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>. The instantaneous voltage of the source is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> when the peak value of current is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is _____ .</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0082_f05d232f2e6e.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 172px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "242",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The reactance of the given inductor is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>.</p><p>The maximum current in the given circuit will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>220</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>242</mn></msqrt><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>242</mn></math></p>"
  }
}